<title>MONACO: TENNIS-MONTE CARLO OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MONTE CARLO OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $2.3</p>
<p>million Monte Carlo men's tennis Open on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>12-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat 6-Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
